      "text": "The UK government says to ask your tour guide's permission before taking any photographs. Canada's travel advice says you must be accompanied by an official guide at all times, that material printed in South Korea or intended for religious proselytising may be seized, and that you can be arrested for unsanctioned political or religious activity."
